          points: ["Opening balance b/d $300 on the credit side (1)", "Bank $5,400 on the credit side (1)", "Balance c/d $450 on the debit side (1)", "Transfer to statement of profit or loss $5,250 on the debit side (1)", "Totals $5,700 (1)", "Balance b/d $450 credit on 1 January 2027, identified as a liability (1)"],
